#1300
The Great Hall~
   Warm firelight from a wide stone hearth illuminates this expansive great
hall. Heavy timber beams span the high vaulted ceiling, and thick woven rugs
cover the polished flagstones. Comfortable armchairs surround a low oak table
near the fire. An archway to the north opens into the dining hall, a heavy
oak door leads east to the bedroom, and a reinforced ironbound door guards
the weapons vault to the west.
~
