#1301
The Dining Hall~
   A long banquet table carved from dark walnut dominates the center of
this hall, flanked by high-backed chairs and lit by wrought-iron candelabras.
Tapestries hang along the stone walls, deadening the echo of footsteps.
The wide archway to the south returns to the great hall.
