#1302
The Master Bedroom~
   Quiet and insulated from the rest of the estate, this chamber holds a
large four-poster bed draped in heavy velvet curtains. A cedar wardrobe and
a polished writing desk sit against the far wall beside a tall, narrow
window looking out over an endless astral expanse. The door to the west
leads back to the great hall.
