#1303
The Weapons Vault~
   Reinforced stone walls lined with oiled hardwood racks and iron-banded
chests enclose this secure armory. Forged stands hold space for blades,
polearms, shields, and enchanted armor, all kept dry and spotless by subtle
protective wards. The heavy ironbound vault door leads east back into the
great hall.
